The Reception Area~
You are now standing in the reception. A small wooden
desk is here and a sign is posted on the wall. The soft 
carpeting under your feet is a nice change from the rugged 
paths you are used to travelling. A wooden stairway leads 
downstairs to the common room where you can get the best
meal of your life.
