#22978
The Post Office~
The newly opened Post Office is the cleanest building in Freeport.  The smell
of freshly cut wood still hangs in the air, overlaid with the less pleasant
smell of just dried varnish.  The walls are still bare, since the Postmaster
has been run off his feet meeting the demands of a city newly connected to
the Midgaard Postal Service.
~
