#22999
The Oubliette of Dispair~
   You have fallen into a deep pit.  The room is a circle approximately fifteen
feet in circumference lit only by a few small flickering torches.  There are no
doors.  The only way out is up.  The walls are made of smooth granite
reinforced with powerful magic.  Skeletons and half decayed bodies litter the
floor.  You blanch in horror as you realize you are in the Dungeon of The
Forsaken.    
~
